# Deferred migrations — authored for this app but NEVER applied to production.
#
# Production was provisioned selectively (SQL-editor pastes + ad-hoc SQL), so
# these files exist in the repo but the live DB never ran them. The runner
# (scripts/applyMigrations.ts) skips every file listed here and reports it as
# "deferred" — remove a line to let that migration apply on the next run, or
# mark it applied-without-executing via:
#   npx tsx scripts/applyMigrations.ts --baseline <YYYYMMDD_filename.sql>
#
# 20260711_referendum_referral_2027.sql is additionally INCOMPATIBLE with the
# production posts table (id is UUID; the migration inserts a text slug) and
# the referendum is retired anyway — keep it listed.

